    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it feels so fake though. like \"creating your own meaning\" is just a lie we tell ourselves so we don't freak out. if the universe is just physics and cold math, then there's no real meaning. it's all just a temporary glitch. it feels like i'm just struggling to stay afloat in something that doesn't even care if i sink or not. it's exhausting to fight for a meaning that isn't actually real.",
